E6.3 - TIL SBOM Logic
Tool Specs
Scope and Audience
This document describes the current Step 6 SBOM logic flow used for TIL applicability support.
Audience:
•	DS leads and SMEs
•	step owners and teammate reviewers
•	architecture and dev teams preparing production design
Primary goals:
•	explain what the SBOM stage does today
•	show where it sits in the Step 6 workflow
•	document script-level contracts (inputs, outputs, key methods)
•	summarize preliminary findings and runtime uncertainties
Active Anchors
Main integration point:
